    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42082" root="وطد" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَطَائِدُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  The <i>foundations,</i> or <i>bases,</i> or the
<i>columns,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوَاعِد</span>,) of a building: (S, L, K:) the
<i>columns</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسَاطِين</span>) of a mosque. (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ وَطَائِدِ الإِسْلَامِ</span> (tropical:)  [<i>Such a person is one of the
columns of el-Islám.</i>] (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَطَائِدُ</span> (tropical:)  <i>The supports called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثَافِىّ</span> of a cooking-pot: (A, K:)
app. pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَطِيدَةٌ</span>. (TA.)

